  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will work towards addressing the challenges of tribal development through setting up a project management unit within the State Tribal department, for an integrated approach in a coordinated manner by designing robust monitoring system, using the advancement in the technological arena, forging innovative partnerships and strengthening capacities to implement and monitor the flagship government programmes and schemes of the Central and State Government for development of tribal men a</narrative>
  </description>
